DTSTART:20260824T171500
DTEND:20260824T175500
SUMMARY:Week 2 · Strength A
DESCRIPTION:2 sets × 12 reps · rest 90s\n\n• Goblet squat — One dumbbell h
 eld at your chest. Sit down between your knees\, chest tall. Heels stay d
 own.\n• Dumbbell floor press — On your back on the floor\, knees bent. El
 bows stop when they touch the ground — that is the depth.\n• Romanian dea
 dlift — Dumbbells in front of your thighs. Push your hips BACK\, not down
 . Stop when you feel the hamstrings\, not when you reach the floor.\n• Sh
 oulder press — Seated or standing. Ribs down\, do not arch your lower bac
 k to get the weight up.\n• Plank — Squeeze your glutes. Hips level with s
 houlders. Stop the set when the hips start to sag\, not when the clock sa
 ys so.\n\n2 sets of 12. Same dumbbells as week 1. Adding reps before weig
 ht is what protects your joints in the first month.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 2 · Strength A
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
