BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8wk-72-20260827T171500@eightweekkitchen
DTSTAMP:20260815T120000Z
DTSTART:20260827T171500
DTEND:20260827T175500
SUMMARY:Week 2 · Strength B
DESCRIPTION:2 sets × 12 reps · rest 90s\n\n• Bent-over row — Hinge to abou
 t 45°\, back flat. Pull the dumbbells to your hips\, not your chest. Paus
 e for a beat at the top.\n• Split squat — One foot forward\, one back\, l
 ong stance. Drop straight down. Do all reps one side\, then the other.\n•
  Glute bridge — Dumbbell across your hips. Drive through your heels\, squ
 eeze hard at the top for a full second.\n• Curl + overhead extension — Cu
 rl up\, then press overhead and lower behind your head. One continuous mo
 vement\, no rest between.\n• Dead bug — On your back\, arms up\, knees at
  90°. Lower opposite arm and leg slowly. Lower back stays glued to the fl
 oor.\n\n2 sets of 12. Same dumbbells as week 1. Adding reps before weight
  is what protects your joints in the first month.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 2 · Strength B
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
