UID:8wk-184-20260914T171500@eightweekkitchen
DTSTAMP:20260815T120000Z
DTSTART:20260914T171500
DTEND:20260914T175500
SUMMARY:Week 5 · Strength A
DESCRIPTION:3 × 12\, 3-second lowering · rest 90s\n\n• Goblet squat — One 
 dumbbell held at your chest. Sit down between your knees\, chest tall. He
 els stay down.\n• Dumbbell floor press — On your back on the floor\, knee
 s bent. Elbows stop when they touch the ground — that is the depth.\n• Ro
 manian deadlift — Dumbbells in front of your thighs. Push your hips BACK\
 , not down. Stop when you feel the hamstrings\, not when you reach the fl
 oor.\n• Shoulder press — Seated or standing. Ribs down\, do not arch your
  lower back to get the weight up.\n• Plank — Squeeze your glutes. Hips le
 vel with shoulders. Stop the set when the hips start to sag\, not when th
 e clock says so.\n\n3 sets of 12\, and start counting three seconds on th
 e way DOWN of every rep. With 20 lb dumbbells\, tempo is how you keep pro
 gressing.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 5 · Strength A
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
