UID:8wk-227-20260921T171500@eightweekkitchen
DTSTAMP:20260815T120000Z
DTSTART:20260921T171500
DTEND:20260921T175500
SUMMARY:Week 6 · Strength A
DESCRIPTION:3 × 12 tempo\, last set to near-failure\n\n• Goblet squat — On
 e dumbbell held at your chest. Sit down between your knees\, chest tall. 
 Heels stay down.\n• Dumbbell floor press — On your back on the floor\, kn
 ees bent. Elbows stop when they touch the ground — that is the depth.\n• 
 Romanian deadlift — Dumbbells in front of your thighs. Push your hips BAC
 K\, not down. Stop when you feel the hamstrings\, not when you reach the 
 floor.\n• Shoulder press — Seated or standing. Ribs down\, do not arch yo
 ur lower back to get the weight up.\n• Plank — Squeeze your glutes. Hips 
 level with shoulders. Stop the set when the hips start to sag\, not when 
 the clock says so.\n\n3 sets of 12 with the 3-second lowering. Last set o
 f each exercise: go until two reps before failure\, however many that is.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 6 · Strength A
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
