 nt. Elbows stop when they touch the ground — that is the depth.\n• Romani
 an deadlift — Dumbbells in front of your thighs. Push your hips BACK\, no
 t down. Stop when you feel the hamstrings\, not when you reach the floor.
 \n• Shoulder press — Seated or standing. Ribs down\, do not arch your low
 er back to get the weight up.\n• Plank — Squeeze your glutes. Hips level 
