SUMMARY:Week 7 · Strength B
DESCRIPTION:3 × 12 tempo + drop set on rows\n\n• Bent-over row — Hinge to 
 about 45°\, back flat. Pull the dumbbells to your hips\, not your chest. 
 Pause for a beat at the top.\n• Split squat — One foot forward\, one back
 \, long stance. Drop straight down. Do all reps one side\, then the other
 .\n• Glute bridge — Dumbbell across your hips. Drive through your heels\,
  squeeze hard at the top for a full second.\n• Curl + overhead extension 
 — Curl up\, then press overhead and lower behind your head. One continuou
 s movement\, no rest between.\n• Dead bug — On your back\, arms up\, knee
 s at 90°. Lower opposite arm and leg slowly. Lower back stays glued to th
 e floor.\n\n3 sets of 12\, tempo\, plus one drop set at the end of squats
  and rows: finish your last set\, drop to a lighter weight\, do 10 more i
 mmediately.
